<h3>About Open Textbook Collaboration Training and Development</h3>

<p>This subcollection includes two classes, OER Basics and OpenNJ System&nbsp; that were developed for the Open Textbook Collaborative (OTC) Career and Technical Education collection. These training resources and OER developed for the OTC was funded by the&nbsp;<a href="https://www2.ed.gov/about/offices/list/ope/fipse/index.html">Fund for the Improvement of Postsecondary Education</a>&nbsp;(FIPSE) of the U.S. Department of Education for the Open Textbooks Pilot grant. The grant runs through 2023.&nbsp; For more information, go to our&nbsp;<a href="https://middlesexcc.libguides.com/OTCProject/home" target="_blank">Open Textbook Collaborative website.</a>&nbsp;</p>

